<title>USA: PDK Labs Inc Q4 Nov 30 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>PDK Labs Inc Q4 Nov 30 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						   November 30,</p>
<p>						   1996		 1995</p>
<p> Net Sales			   $ 13,348,382	$ 11,180,023</p>
<p> Net Earnings (Loss)		    833,891	   (431,621)</p>
<p> Average Shares			 3,139,019	   2,758,138</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss) Per Share(a)	   .24		 (.19)</p>
<p>NOTE:  After dividends on convertible preferred shares of $90,594 ($.03 per common share) in 1996 and $90,594 ($.04 per common share) in 1995.</p>
<p>The company said the net profit for 1996 is primarily attributable to a non-recurring inventory write off necessitated by regulatory action in the fourth quarter of 1995 and increased sales and operating income.</p>
</text>
